			"updated": 1773668151708,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "\nEnterprise Integration Patterns by Gregor Hohpe\n  - File Transfer, Shared DB, RPC, Messaging.\n         \nMessaging: Reason for messaging/Broker: Point-to-point mess . ( Airport Hub example)\n  - Broker Producer, Consumer.\n  - Types of use case: low latency. (Async) \n         State-based systems: request-response or Request Driven systems\n         Event-Driven Systems, Document migration, Analytical Dashboard\n      - 3 types of Message: Event, Command, Document.\nTimeline of Confluent platform components.\n  - Apache Kafka: 2012; 2015:SR, connect, RP ;2016:connect, kafkastreams;2018:ksql, 2020:ksqlDB;2022:Kraft;2024:cp-flink; 2025: tableflow\n   \n",
			"rawText": "\nEnterprise Integration Patterns by Gregor Hohpe\n  - File Transfer, Shared DB, RPC, Messaging.\n         \nMessaging: Reason for messaging/Broker: Point-to-point mess . ( Airport Hub example)\n  - Broker Producer, Consumer.\n  - Types of use case: low latency. (Async) \n         State-based systems: request-response or Request Driven systems\n         Event-Driven Systems, Document migration, Analytical Dashboard\n      - 3 types of Message: Event, Command, Document.\nTimeline of Confluent platform components.\n  - Apache Kafka: 2012; 2015:SR, connect, RP ;2016:connect, kafkastreams;2018:ksql, 2020:ksqlDB;2022:Kraft;2024:cp-flink; 2025: tableflow\n   \n",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "\nEnterprise Integration Patterns by Gregor Hohpe\n  - File Transfer, Shared DB, RPC, Messaging.\n         \nMessaging: Reason for messaging/Broker: Point-to-point mess . ( Airport Hub example)\n  - Broker Producer, Consumer.\n  - Types of use case: low latency. (Async) \n         State-based systems: request-response or Request Driven systems\n         Event-Driven Systems, Document migration, Analytical Dashboard\n      - 3 types of Message: Event, Command, Document.\nTimeline of Confluent platform components.\n  - Apache Kafka: 2012; 2015:SR, connect, RP ;2016:connect, kafkastreams;2018:ksql, 2020:ksqlDB;2022:Kraft;2024:cp-flink; 2025: tableflow\n   \n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25
		},
