			"text": "- Constructs vs constrains ( Message:k,v; Topic: Many message; Schema (or event type):Structure of message(k,v);Subject:schema,v1)\n- Constraints: Key and value has different schemas.\n                  Schema-message ( message has a structure)\n                   subject-schema ( schema,v1 or v2, depends on the compatibility level of schema)\n                   subject-topic (defualt NamingStrategy: topicnamingstrategy, topic-key, topic-value, Colour coding the pipes)\nother Strategy: recordnaming(customershippingupdate,customeraddressupdate), topicrecordnaming",
			"rawText": "- Constructs vs constrains ( Message:k,v; Topic: Many message; Schema (or event type):Structure of message(k,v);Subject:schema,v1)\n- Constraints: Key and value has different schemas.\n                  Schema-message ( message has a structure)\n                   subject-schema ( schema,v1 or v2, depends on the compatibility level of schema)\n                   subject-topic (defualt NamingStrategy: topicnamingstrategy, topic-key, topic-value, Colour coding the pipes)\nother Strategy: recordnaming(customershippingupdate,customeraddressupdate), topicrecordnaming",
